{"text": "Before leaving, the king went out to find the hermit and ask him the questions one last time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The hermit was on his knees, sowing seeds in the beds that the king had dug the day before. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You have already been answered, said the hermit, looking up at the king. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If you had not felt sorry for my weakness and stayed with me, that man would have attacked you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So the most important time was when you were digging, and I was the most important person. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And to do good for me was your most important work. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later, when that man ran to us, the most important time was when you were caring for him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If you had not bandaged his wound, he would have died without making peace with you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Remember, there is only one important time, and that is now, because it is the only time we have power over. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The most important person is the one you are with, for nobody knows whether he will meet anyone else. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the most important thing is to do good for that person, because that is why we were sent into this life.", "alignment": {"characters": ["B", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", " ", "l", "e", "a", "v", "i", "n", "g", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "f", "i", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "h", "e", "r", "m", "i", "t", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", "s", "k", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "q", "u", "e", "s", "t", "i", "o", "n", "s", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "h", "e", "r", "m", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "o", "n", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "k", "n", "e", "e", "s", ",", " ",